message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "SAMNJ24 build code: a social accounting matrix for New Jersey 2024"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic Python chain that builds the Social Accounting Matrix for New
  Jersey 2024 (SAMNJ24) from New Jersey's 2024 state input-output accounts and
  the national 421-sector supply-use tables: the state direct-requirements and
  Use matrices, the 65-account core SAM, the 19-account institutional SAM, the
  control totals, and the 75-account core SAM with federal, state and local
  government, five tax accounts and a subsidy account. Also includes the
  upstream RECON2024 package and scripts that produce the state inputs.
